# Safe Controller Component

Monitors Safe multisig wallets that control 0xSplits contracts, validating recovery transactions and signer configurations.

## Key Integration Pattern
Alert-based monitoring pattern where each alert type (queue excess, missing recovery, invalid params) maintains its own state to prevent duplicate notifications.

## Important Constraints
- Recovery transaction allocations must match expected values exactly (no tolerance)
- Uses singleton metrics pattern - always access via GetMetricsInstance()
- Transaction queue monitoring runs every 12 seconds with Safe API polling